    "translationStatus": "source-only",
    "content": "先举了三个例子\r\n\r\n![](https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-56e525dec7532c506bf79d88ceac22f0_r.jpg)\r\n\r\n主要是表示周期输入会导致状态轨线的[周期性](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=266797128&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E6%80%A7&zhida_source=entity)。随后考虑n维[非线性](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=266797128&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=%E9%9D%9E%E7%BA%BF%E6%80%A7&zhida_source=entity)周期系统，研究其周期解，同时加入一个非线性扰动g，考虑在已知周期解情况下，扰动是否会破坏周期解，若存在，扰动系数趋于零时其能否收敛于原无扰动系统周期解。\r\n\r\n![](/blog-assets/zhihu/1976390320955597206/image-02.jpg)\r\n\r\n例子说明了[扰动](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=266797128&content_type=Article&match_order=5&q=%E6%89%B0%E5%8A%A8&zhida_source=entity)可以破坏周期解，能否被破坏取决于原系统的性质。于是在周期解附近线性化。\r\n\r\n![](https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-bd0ee9c87868bad57b3125656371abb5_r.jpg)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n![](/blog-assets/zhihu/1976390320955597206/image-04.jpg)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n![](https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-2d980e994d2606725c5ccccad1ddabe4_r.jpg)\r\n\r\n利用[隐函数定理](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=266797128&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=%E9%9A%90%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86&zhida_source=entity)，我们得到了最终的定理。无扰动系统在[周期轨](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=266797128&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E8%BD%A8&zhida_source=entity)附近线性化后的线性系统[基解矩阵](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=266797128&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=%E5%9F%BA%E8%A7%A3%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5&zhida_source=entity)如果有一个1作为[单特征值](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=266797128&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=%E5%8D%95%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%81%E5%80%BC&zhida_source=entity)，则对于充分小的非线性扰动，仍存在周期轨。（均为孤立闭轨）\r\n\r\n![](/blog-assets/zhihu/1976390320955597206/image-06.jpg)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n![](/blog-assets/zhihu/1976390320955597206/image-08.jpg)\r\n\r\n孤立的闭轨即为[极限环](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=266797128&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E7%8E%AF&zhida_source=entity)，下面研究二维[自治系统](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=266797128&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=%E8%87%AA%E6%B2%BB%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F&zhida_source=entity)的极限环。定义了极限环的稳定与半稳定，同样用[后继函数法](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=266797128&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%A7%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%B3%95&zhida_source=entity)。\r\n\r\n![](https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-65318e4d441946ab396029fb6c2f11db_r.jpg)\r\n\r\n后继函数的导数判断是否为[压缩映射](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=266797128&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%E6%98%A0%E5%B0%84&zhida_source=entity)，就反映了稳定性。[奇数阶导数](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=266797128&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=%E5%A5%87%E6%95%B0%E9%98%B6%E5%AF%BC%E6%95%B0&zhida_source=entity)和偶数阶导数反映了半稳定性。\r\n\r\n![](https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-b63dd95cf7a2ea74e333b26fb3aea316_r.jpg)\r\n\r\n下面定义了平面上极限环的指数，找到对应于指数的稳定性判别。引入[法坐标](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=266797128&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=%E6%B3%95%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87&zhida_source=entity)。\r\n\r\n![](https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-9db506e4561d8eece0fa214ebc8e2739_r.jpg)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n![](https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-02a0b13aaf7525d3ff2ef5ad0ddaabc1_r.jpg)\r\n\r\n定义了极限环的指数，其正负就代表了稳定性。\r\n\r\n![](/blog-assets/zhihu/1976390320955597206/image-10.jpg)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n![](/blog-assets/zhihu/1976390320955597206/image-12.jpg)\r\n"
