    "content": "Lyapunoc稳定性是控制理论的基石，本文是很久以前学习[Khalil《非线性系统》](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=249747219&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=Khalil%E3%80%8A%E9%9D%9E%E7%BA%BF%E6%80%A7%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E3%80%8B&zhida_source=entity)的笔记。\n\n在本书乃至[控制理论](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=249747219&content_type=Article&match_order=2&q=%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA&zhida_source=entity)中本章的内容都起到了统领全文的作用，时常就会用到本章的结果。\n\n![](https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-96032e8bd7f88da01bc07175d25e10f4_r.jpg)\n\n\n\n![](https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6db5edff2aacf13c88f7145a04917c51_r.jpg)\n\n\n\n![](https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8d06046505335aa495577917598d9259_r.jpg)\n\n\n\n![](/blog-assets/zhihu/3623580054/image-02.jpg)\n\n\n\n![](/blog-assets/zhihu/3623580054/image-04.jpg)\n\n\n\n![](/blog-assets/zhihu/3623580054/image-06.jpg)\n\n\n\n![](/blog-assets/zhihu/3623580054/image-08.jpg)\n"
